ffer except after knowledge had come to them - out of jealous animosity between themselves. Indeed, your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ.","j":25,"h":50,"s":45,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"45:18","t":"Then We put you, [O Muḥammad], on an ordained way concerning the matter [of religion]; so follow it and do not follow the inclinations of those who do not know.","j":25,"h":50,"s":45,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"45:19","t":"Indeed, they will never avail you against Allāh at all. And indeed, the wrongdoers are allies of one another; but Allāh is the protector of the righteous.","j":25,"h":50,"s":45,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"45:20","t":"This [Qur’ān] is enlightenment for mankind and guidance and mercy for a people who are certain [in faith].","j":25,"h":50,"s":45,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"45:21","t":"Or do those who commit evils think We will make them like those who have believed and done righteous deeds - [make them] equal in their life and their death? Evil is that which they judge [i.e., assume].","j":25,"h":50,"s":45,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"45:22","t":"And Allāh created the heavens and earth in truth and so that every soul may be recompensed for what it has earned, and they will not be wronged.","j":25,"h":50,"s":45,"a":22,"sd":null}],"juz":25,"hizb":50,"surahs":[45],"sajdah":false}